# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Pretty URLs for the early-access page (nice for sales-email links).
# NOTE: target the CLEAN url /waitlist (not /waitlist.html). Pages auto-redirects
# /waitlist.html → /waitlist, so redirecting to /waitlist.html would loop.
/design-partner   /waitlist   302
/early-access     /waitlist   302

# NOTE: /operator/shipment/<id> and /verify/<id> are handled by Pages Functions
